  * `:style` (`t:String.t/0`) - *Since Playwright 1.41.* Text of the stylesheet to apply while making the screenshot. This is where you can hide dynamic elements, make elements invisible
    or change their properties to help you creating repeatable screenshots. This stylesheet pierces the Shadow DOM and applies
